    ["<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>阵营与基础规则</>\n<Highlight>4家俱乐部</>同场竞技，每家俱乐部可以出战<Highlight>60名正式成员</>，单局共240名玩家展开激战。同一俱乐部单个途径最多上场<Highlight>16人</>，请合理规划阵容配置。每场比赛持续<Highlight>23分钟</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>胜负规则</>\n<Highlight>率先获得3000积分</>的俱乐部即刻锁定胜局；若对局结束时无人达到3000分，则按当前积分高低排定名次。积分相同时，依次比较<Highlight>总击杀数</>、<Highlight>俱乐部非凡评分总和</>。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>局内积分获取</>\n局内积分的唯一来源为<Highlight>占领守卫及守卫归属结算</>：首次占领守卫可获得<Highlight>50积分</>；每5秒进行一次小归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>1积分</>；每30秒进行一次大归属结算，每个已占领守卫提供<Highlight>18积分</>。<Highlight>守卫归属高倍积分结算</>将在比赛第4、8、12、16、20分钟随机刷新，并提前90秒预告。高倍结算期间，每个已占领守卫在大归属结算时可提供<Highlight>72积分或108积分</>，分别对应四倍与六倍积分收益，具体倍率根据刷新的守卫位置决定。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>守卫争夺</>\n地图中共设有<Highlight>5位守卫</>。完成对守卫最后一击的俱乐部将获得该守卫的控制权。占领成功后，守卫将立即重生并归属本方。守卫<Highlight>无法被治疗</>，但周围没有敌人时可以缓慢自动恢复生命。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>资源与指挥权限</>\n<Highlight>击败敌方玩家</>或<Highlight>占领守卫</>均可获得资源点，并自动积累<Highlight>士气等级</>。<Highlight>会长、副会长、理事</>可以消耗资源点释放指挥技能。\n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title>指挥技能</>\n<Highlight>克敌宣言</>：消耗1000资源点，使本方全体成员的全途径压制提高15%，持续20秒。冷却时间180秒。<Highlight>急行进军</>：消耗600资源点，使本方全体成员的移动速度提高60%，持续10秒。冷却时间120秒。<Highlight>归零敕令</>：消耗1500资源点，立即清除本方全体成员当前的复活等待；随后5秒内阵亡的本方成员同样可以立即复活。冷却时间240秒。<Highlight>召集传送</>：消耗2400资源点，将本方全体成员召集至指定集结点。冷却时间240秒。<Highlight>圣域庇佑</>：消耗1000资源点，使本方所有守卫恢复相当于其最大生命值50%的生命。冷却时间180秒。\n"] = "<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Factions and Basic Rules </>\n<Highlight> 4 Clubs </> compete on the same field, with each Club fielding <Highlight> 60 official members </>, totaling 240 players in a single match. A single Pathway can have a maximum of <Highlight> 16 players </> from the same Club on the field; please plan your lineup configuration reasonably. Each match lasts <Highlight> 23 minutes </>. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Victory Conditions </>\n<Highlight> The first Club to reach 3000 points </> immediately secures victory; if no one reaches 3000 points when the match ends, the ranking is determined by the current points. If points are tied, the <Highlight> total kills </> and <Highlight> total Club Потусторонний rating </> are compared in order. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> In-Match Point Acquisition </>\n The only source of in-match points is <Highlight> occupying Guardians and Guardian ownership settlement </>: The first occupation of a Guardian grants <Highlight> 50 points </>; a minor ownership settlement occurs every 5 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 1 point </>; a major ownership settlement occurs every 30 seconds, with each occupied Guardian providing <Highlight> 18 points </>. <Highlight> High-multiplier Guardian ownership settlement </> will refresh randomly at the 4th, 8th, 12th, 16th, and 20th minutes of the match, with a 90-second advance notice. During high-multiplier settlements, each occupied Guardian can provide <Highlight> 72 points or 108 points </> during the major ownership settlement, corresponding to four times and six times the point yield, respectively, with the specific multiplier determined by the refreshed Guardian location. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Guardian Contention </>\n There are <Highlight> 5 Guardians </> on the map. The Club that lands the final blow on a Guardian will gain control of it. After a successful occupation, the Guardian will immediately respawn and belong to your side. Guardians <Highlight> cannot be healed </>, but they can slowly recover Health automatically when there are no enemies nearby. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Resources and Command Authority </>\n<Highlight> Defeating enemy players </> or <Highlight> occupying Guardians </> will grant resource points and automatically accumulate <Highlight> Morale Level </>. <Highlight> The President, Vice President, and Council Members </> can consume resource points to unleash Command Skills. \n<img id=\"Tips\" width=\"30\" height=\"46\"/><Title> Command Skills </>\n<Highlight> Declaration of Defeating the Enemy </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to increase the all-Pathway Suppression of all your members by 15% for 20 seconds. Перезарядка 180 seconds. <Highlight> Forced March </>: Consumes 600 resource points to increase the Скорость бега of all your members by 60% for 10 seconds. Перезарядка 120 seconds. <Highlight> Zero-Order Edict </>: Consumes 1500 resource points to immediately clear the current Resurrection wait time for all your members; members of your side who fall in battle within the following 5 seconds can also be resurrected immediately. Перезарядка 240 seconds. <Highlight> Summon Teleport </>: Consumes 2400 resource points to summon all your members to a designated assembly point. Перезарядка 240 seconds. <Highlight> Sanctuary Protection </>: Consumes 1000 resource points to restore 50% of the maximum Health of all your Guardians. Перезарядка 180 seconds. \n",
